mission to recover a princess' stolen ruby from the notorious French thief the Whisperer.

14
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:28,500
Reluctantly accompanied by three cute little kittens called the Three
Diablos, Puss must tame them before they endanger the mission.

15
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:17,250
